trend_g10.py: G10 entry parameters, Phase 2 tables. Every computed number is derived.

==============================================================================
T0. Engine entry constants read from the source (regex, no cargo)
==============================================================================
  a3d_ramp_deg                 10.000   crates/rs_cam_core/src/compute/operation_configs.rs:832
  a3d_helix_factor              0.300   crates/rs_cam_core/src/compute/operation_configs.rs:836
  a3d_helix_pitch               2.000   crates/rs_cam_core/src/compute/operation_configs.rs:840
  dr_ramp_deg                   3.000   crates/rs_cam_core/src/compute/config.rs:1036
  dr_helix_r_mm                 2.000   crates/rs_cam_core/src/compute/config.rs:1037
  dr_helix_pitch                1.000   crates/rs_cam_core/src/compute/config.rs:1038
  entry_contact_clearance       0.500   crates/rs_cam_core/src/dressup/entry_descent.rs:356
  entry_clearance_nominal       2.000   crates/rs_cam_core/src/dressup/entry_descent.rs:131
  pencil_ramp_deg              12.000   crates/rs_cam_core/src/finish/pencil/emission.rs:70
  plunge_wood_6mm            1000.000   crates/rs_cam_core/src/material/mod.rs:1174
  plunge_sheet_6mm            900.000   crates/rs_cam_core/src/material/mod.rs:1175
  ball_cap_per_mm             150.000   crates/rs_cam_core/src/feeds/mod.rs:2558
  cli_2d_ramp_deg               3.000   crates/rs_cam_cli/src/job.rs:1116
  cli_2d_helix_r_mm             2.000   crates/rs_cam_cli/src/job.rs:1120
  cli_2d_helix_pitch            1.000   crates/rs_cam_cli/src/job.rs:1121
  cli_3d_helix_factor           0.400   crates/rs_cam_cli/src/job.rs:1351
  cli_3d_helix_pitch            1.000   crates/rs_cam_cli/src/job.rs:1352
  cli_3d_ramp_deg               3.000   crates/rs_cam_cli/src/job.rs:1356
  FM1: Z = 2 on every tool kind; bull corner 0.15 x D; V-bit 60 deg; tapered ball diameter = tip.

