  CLI Adaptive3d         0.4D         1.0 |   7.14     3.79     3.59     1.79  
  CLI Adaptive3d, p 2    0.4D         2.0 |  14.07     7.55     7.14     3.59  

  Printed helix / ramp angles (all grade c, metal):
    g10-metal-imco-iptc-angle    IPT/C 7, 9, 11, 13 (7-13 flute)          0.5°
    g10-metal-imco-aptc-angle    APT/C 5                                  3°
    g10-metal-imco-m5-angle      M525, M527, M503, M726, M706, M806, M924 1° - 2.5°
    g10-metal-imco-m2-angle      M223, M233, M203, M202                   3° - 5°
    Harvey / Helical ramp (linear or circular), soft / non-ferrous 3-10 deg, hard / ferrous 1-3 deg
    Sandvik: pitch never larger than the maximum ap of the insert (no angle)
  No wood, router or hobby source prints a pitch or a helix angle. Fusion defines the fields with no value.

